    "# Text Mining Project — Slur Corpus (Kurrek et al. 2020)\n",
    "**Task 1: Classification** (RAPT — DEG vs. non-DEG) · **Task 2: Clustering** (on RAPT embeddings)\n",
    "\n",
    "Dataset: 40,003 Reddit comments containing one of three slurs (tranny/nigger/faggot), labeled DEG/NDG/HOM/APR/CMP.\n",
    "We binarize as **DEG (derogatory) vs. non-DEG** (everything else) — matches the original paper's own benchmark, citable for comparative evaluation.\n",
    "\n",
    "Set `DATA_PATH` below to your CSV file."
   ]
  },
  {
